msgstr "Backup from {created_display} (version {version}, {anzahl} files).\n\nAt the next start this data replaces the current database, AI cache, model and settings. The previous files are kept in the data folder under “{PREVIOUS_DIR}”.\n\nPDF Sortier Meister will now close for this. Continue?"

